    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but it feels so much easier to just accept it. like, why fight to stay visible if the world has already decided i'm not there? if i'm already basically dead to everyone, maybe there's a certain kind of peace in just letting it all go for real. it feels like i'm just lingering in a space i don't belong in anymore.",
